-- ===== 테스트용 가짜 데이터 시작 (실제 운영 DB에서는 이 아래를 실행하지 않음) =====
-- 테스트용 가짜 데이터 (2026-11-18)
-- 대상: aa_battery_inspection (라인 테이블 + 주문 테이블). 주문 테이블이 먼저 만들어져 있어야 합니다.
-- **테스트 DB에서만** 실행하세요. 처음에 같은 가짜 데이터를 지우고 다시 넣으므로 여러 번 실행해도 됩니다.
-- 지울 때는 가짜데이터_지우기.sql. 가짜 데이터 표시: 회차 번호 끝 -fa01~-fa07, 판정 기준 v1.0-test,
--   환경·비상정지 ID fake-…, 주문·문의 번호는 지우기 스크립트에 목록으로 있음.
-- 날짜는 2026-11-10 ~ 2026-11-18 오전. 오늘(11/18) 회차는 진행 중이라 종료 시각이 없습니다.
-- depaladmin_users(관리자 계정)는 비밀번호 해시 방식이 프로그램에 있어서 넣지 않았습니다.

USE `aa_battery_inspection`;

-- 1) 이전 가짜 데이터 지우기
-- MySQL Workbench의 안전 모드(키 없는 DELETE 막기)를 이 스크립트 동안만 끔
SET @OLD_SQL_SAFE_UPDATES = @@SQL_SAFE_UPDATES;
SET SQL_SAFE_UPDATES = 0;

-- 라인 가짜 데이터
DELETE FROM visual_defects WHERE visual_inspection_id IN (SELECT visual_inspection_id FROM visual_inspections WHERE cycle_id IN (SELECT b.cycle_id FROM battery_cycles b JOIN runs r ON r.run_id = b.run_id WHERE r.source_run_id IN ('20261110-140500-fa01', '20261112-102000-fa02', '20261113-154000-fa03', '20261114-110000-fa04', '20261116-133000-fa05', '20261117-101500-fa06', '20261118-091000-fa07')));
DELETE FROM visual_inspections WHERE cycle_id IN (SELECT b.cycle_id FROM battery_cycles b JOIN runs r ON r.run_id = b.run_id WHERE r.source_run_id IN ('20261110-140500-fa01', '20261112-102000-fa02', '20261113-154000-fa03', '20261114-110000-fa04', '20261116-133000-fa05', '20261117-101500-fa06', '20261118-091000-fa07'));
DELETE FROM electrical_tests WHERE cycle_id IN (SELECT b.cycle_id FROM battery_cycles b JOIN runs r ON r.run_id = b.run_id WHERE r.source_run_id IN ('20261110-140500-fa01', '20261112-102000-fa02', '20261113-154000-fa03', '20261114-110000-fa04', '20261116-133000-fa05', '20261117-101500-fa06', '20261118-091000-fa07'));
DELETE FROM equipment_events WHERE run_id IN (SELECT run_id FROM runs WHERE source_run_id IN ('20261110-140500-fa01', '20261112-102000-fa02', '20261113-154000-fa03', '20261114-110000-fa04', '20261116-133000-fa05', '20261117-101500-fa06', '20261118-091000-fa07'));
DELETE FROM battery_cycles WHERE run_id IN (SELECT run_id FROM runs WHERE source_run_id IN ('20261110-140500-fa01', '20261112-102000-fa02', '20261113-154000-fa03', '20261114-110000-fa04', '20261116-133000-fa05', '20261117-101500-fa06', '20261118-091000-fa07'));
DELETE FROM communication_logs WHERE source_run_id IN ('20261110-140500-fa01', '20261112-102000-fa02', '20261113-154000-fa03', '20261114-110000-fa04', '20261116-133000-fa05', '20261117-101500-fa06', '20261118-091000-fa07');
DELETE FROM runs WHERE source_run_id IN ('20261110-140500-fa01', '20261112-102000-fa02', '20261113-154000-fa03', '20261114-110000-fa04', '20261116-133000-fa05', '20261117-101500-fa06', '20261118-091000-fa07');
DELETE FROM grading_rules WHERE rule_version = 'v1.0-test' AND rule_id NOT IN (SELECT rule_id FROM battery_cycles WHERE rule_id IS NOT NULL);
DELETE FROM environment_readings WHERE source_reading_id LIKE 'fake-env-%';
DELETE FROM emergency_stop_events WHERE source_event_id LIKE 'fake-estop-%';

-- 주문 가짜 데이터
-- 재고: 가짜 기록으로 더했던 만큼 먼저 뺌 (실제 재고는 그대로 남음)
UPDATE stock SET stock_packs = stock_packs - COALESCE((SELECT SUM(l.delta_packs) FROM stock_log l
    WHERE l.product_id = stock.product_id AND (l.order_no IN ('BR-20261110-CGWJ', 'BR-20261110-UV9G', 'BR-20261111-PNYQ', 'BR-20261111-Y6AJ', 'BR-20261112-5WWH', 'BR-20261112-XLES', 'BR-20261112-EKUC', 'BR-20261113-V73K', 'BR-20261113-4Y88', 'BR-20261113-P7V3', 'BR-20261114-AJHH', 'BR-20261114-DSAF', 'BR-20261114-G8HX', 'BR-20261115-LF49', 'BR-20261115-TP4B', 'BR-20261116-PAHK', 'BR-20261116-UQZS', 'BR-20261116-F8JZ', 'BR-20261116-3CBP', 'BR-20261116-8QBE', 'BR-20261117-HJDH', 'BR-20261117-LSMS', 'BR-20261118-HW7T', 'BR-20261118-V25C', 'BR-20261118-RBF6', 'BR-20261118-U2AF') OR l.source_event_id IN ('fa2f916126a688a49f221144c127e351', 'fadc0b60a77e285bc8f7d896084aba68', 'fa2582e18cdc7b8eff9a2384bd2c758c', 'fa6cc1dc5aa810da365194e0e9dc31b8', 'faf2c7ec898f2d770f881cfc5ac6e785', 'fa309c93feefe4ebd9ec05dae6cc9130', 'fae349c7658ffdc8a21e25dddb957903'))), 0)
  WHERE product_id IN ('aa4', 'aa12', 'aa24', 'aar2');
DELETE FROM stock_log WHERE order_no IN ('BR-20261110-CGWJ', 'BR-20261110-UV9G', 'BR-20261111-PNYQ', 'BR-20261111-Y6AJ', 'BR-20261112-5WWH', 'BR-20261112-XLES', 'BR-20261112-EKUC', 'BR-20261113-V73K', 'BR-20261113-4Y88', 'BR-20261113-P7V3', 'BR-20261114-AJHH', 'BR-20261114-DSAF', 'BR-20261114-G8HX', 'BR-20261115-LF49', 'BR-20261115-TP4B', 'BR-20261116-PAHK', 'BR-20261116-UQZS', 'BR-20261116-F8JZ', 'BR-20261116-3CBP', 'BR-20261116-8QBE', 'BR-20261117-HJDH', 'BR-20261117-LSMS', 'BR-20261118-HW7T', 'BR-20261118-V25C', 'BR-20261118-RBF6', 'BR-20261118-U2AF') OR source_event_id IN ('fa2f916126a688a49f221144c127e351', 'fadc0b60a77e285bc8f7d896084aba68', 'fa2582e18cdc7b8eff9a2384bd2c758c', 'fa6cc1dc5aa810da365194e0e9dc31b8', 'faf2c7ec898f2d770f881cfc5ac6e785', 'fa309c93feefe4ebd9ec05dae6cc9130', 'fae349c7658ffdc8a21e25dddb957903');
DELETE FROM order_runs WHERE order_no IN ('BR-20261110-CGWJ', 'BR-20261110-UV9G', 'BR-20261111-PNYQ', 'BR-20261111-Y6AJ', 'BR-20261112-5WWH', 'BR-20261112-XLES', 'BR-20261112-EKUC', 'BR-20261113-V73K', 'BR-20261113-4Y88', 'BR-20261113-P7V3', 'BR-20261114-AJHH', 'BR-20261114-DSAF', 'BR-20261114-G8HX', 'BR-20261115-LF49', 'BR-20261115-TP4B', 'BR-20261116-PAHK', 'BR-20261116-UQZS', 'BR-20261116-F8JZ', 'BR-20261116-3CBP', 'BR-20261116-8QBE', 'BR-20261117-HJDH', 'BR-20261117-LSMS', 'BR-20261118-HW7T', 'BR-20261118-V25C', 'BR-20261118-RBF6', 'BR-20261118-U2AF');
DELETE FROM order_status_log WHERE order_no IN ('BR-20261110-CGWJ', 'BR-20261110-UV9G', 'BR-20261111-PNYQ', 'BR-20261111-Y6AJ', 'BR-20261112-5WWH', 'BR-20261112-XLES', 'BR-20261112-EKUC', 'BR-20261113-V73K', 'BR-20261113-4Y88', 'BR-20261113-P7V3', 'BR-20261114-AJHH', 'BR-20261114-DSAF', 'BR-20261114-G8HX', 'BR-20261115-LF49', 'BR-20261115-TP4B', 'BR-20261116-PAHK', 'BR-20261116-UQZS', 'BR-20261116-F8JZ', 'BR-20261116-3CBP', 'BR-20261116-8QBE', 'BR-20261117-HJDH', 'BR-20261117-LSMS', 'BR-20261118-HW7T', 'BR-20261118-V25C', 'BR-20261118-RBF6', 'BR-20261118-U2AF');
DELETE FROM order_items WHERE order_no IN ('BR-20261110-CGWJ', 'BR-20261110-UV9G', 'BR-20261111-PNYQ', 'BR-20261111-Y6AJ', 'BR-20261112-5WWH', 'BR-20261112-XLES', 'BR-20261112-EKUC', 'BR-20261113-V73K', 'BR-20261113-4Y88', 'BR-20261113-P7V3', 'BR-20261114-AJHH', 'BR-20261114-DSAF', 'BR-20261114-G8HX', 'BR-20261115-LF49', 'BR-20261115-TP4B', 'BR-20261116-PAHK', 'BR-20261116-UQZS', 'BR-20261116-F8JZ', 'BR-20261116-3CBP', 'BR-20261116-8QBE', 'BR-20261117-HJDH', 'BR-20261117-LSMS', 'BR-20261118-HW7T', 'BR-20261118-V25C', 'BR-20261118-RBF6', 'BR-20261118-U2AF');
DELETE FROM orders WHERE order_no IN ('BR-20261110-CGWJ', 'BR-20261110-UV9G', 'BR-20261111-PNYQ', 'BR-20261111-Y6AJ', 'BR-20261112-5WWH', 'BR-20261112-XLES', 'BR-20261112-EKUC', 'BR-20261113-V73K', 'BR-20261113-4Y88', 'BR-20261113-P7V3', 'BR-20261114-AJHH', 'BR-20261114-DSAF', 'BR-20261114-G8HX', 'BR-20261115-LF49', 'BR-20261115-TP4B', 'BR-20261116-PAHK', 'BR-20261116-UQZS', 'BR-20261116-F8JZ', 'BR-20261116-3CBP', 'BR-20261116-8QBE', 'BR-20261117-HJDH', 'BR-20261117-LSMS', 'BR-20261118-HW7T', 'BR-20261118-V25C', 'BR-20261118-RBF6', 'BR-20261118-U2AF');
DELETE FROM inquiries WHERE inquiry_id IN ('Q-20261111-3V3P', 'Q-20261112-UH2F', 'Q-20261113-BDJS', 'Q-20261114-WMM5', 'Q-20261115-77YR', 'Q-20261116-Q6D3', 'Q-20261117-AW5L', 'Q-20261118-BTP2');
-- 가짜 데이터가 새로 만든 재고 행만 지움 (다른 기록이 없고 0팩인 행)
DELETE FROM stock WHERE product_id IN ('aa4', 'aa12', 'aa24', 'aar2') AND stock_packs = 0
  AND product_id NOT IN (SELECT product_id FROM stock_log);

-- 2) 가짜 데이터 넣기
START TRANSACTION;

-- 판정 기준

-- 작업 회차 (마지막 회차는 오늘 진행 중이라 종료 시각 없음)

-- 건전지 검사 결과

